	"title"		"深空当铺：鉴定学 / Probably Stolen: Appraisal Studies"
	"description"		"[h1]深空当铺：鉴定学[/h1]\n当前版本：v0.6.1\n\n也许你还在为原版鉴定内容太过单一而苦恼？或许你需要这个模组！\n\n《深空当铺：鉴定学》为深空当铺的鉴定部分加入了 4 个鉴定品，并对原版的鉴定等级晋升途径进行了修改——现在你需要考证了。\n\n[h2]新的鉴定品[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]仿生指节——仿生机械手上的一种可替换部件。\n[*]个人环境检测仪——一种便携的环境检测装置，可以为用户提供实时环境数据。\n[*]腕式通讯终端——小天才手表 pro plus ultra。\n[*]第九环港开港纪念币——珍贵的纪念币，象征着星际时代的开启。\n[/list]\n\n[h2]玩法改变[/h2]\n执证上岗是空间站的基本规则，不过最近鉴定行会的家伙们又从一些旧时代的数据里翻出了一些新花样——考证。\n\n现在，当晋升进度累积至 100% 时，鉴定行会的鉴定师不会再主动来找你，你需要电话预约考试。考官会在预约的第二天出现。\n\n[h2]未来计划[/h2]\n未来鉴定学计划继续更新新的鉴定品，等到初级鉴定师的 8 个鉴定品更新完成后会正式发布 1.0 版本。预计本模组最终将带来 32 个新鉴定品——每鉴定等级解锁 8 个，敬请期待！\n\n[h2]AI 参与[/h2]\n本模组的手册、文案采用了 DeepSeek 进行制作，鉴定品的鉴定基图使用了 Retro Diffusion Pro 进行制作，鉴定图的所有差分则均由鄙人手绘完成。\n\n[h2]闲言碎语[/h2]\n由于本人常年游玩各类游戏，或许后续的更新内容中会出现一些动漫小人 AwA（期待捏。在本次的更新内容里，其实也有一个对其他游戏的致敬，具体致敬的游戏是《彼方的她 Aliya》，欢迎大家找彩蛋 :)。本模组是鄙人制作的第一个模组，这也是鄙人第一次尝试手绘像素画，有诸多不足之处，各位请多担待。如有 bug、建议与意见，可先在评论区提交，后续鄙人会上传 GitHub，届时可提交 issue。\n\n----------\n\n[h1]Appraisal Studies[/h1]\nCurrent version: v0.6.1\n\nAre you still bothered by how monotonous the vanilla appraisal content is? Maybe you need this mod!\n\nAppraisal Studies adds 4 new appraisal items to the appraisal side of Probably Stolen, and reworks the vanilla promotion path for appraisal ranks — now you need to sit an exam.\n\n[h2]New appraisal items[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Cybernetic Knuckle — a replaceable part on a cybernetic hand.\n[*]Personal Environment Scanner — a portable environmental scanning device that gives the user live environmental data.\n[*]Wrist Comm Terminal — the kids' smartwatch pro plus ultra.\n[*]Ninth Ring Port Commemorative Coin — a treasured commemorative coin, marking the beginning of the interstellar age.\n[/list]\n\n[h2]Gameplay changes[/h2]\nWorking with a licence is a basic rule on the station, but lately the folks at the Appraiser Guild have dug some new tricks out of old-world data — exams.\n\nNow, once promotion progress reaches 100%, the guild's appraiser will no longer come to you on their own. You need to book the exam by phone. The examiner shows up the day after you book.\n\n[h2]Future plans[/h2]\nAppraisal Studies will keep adding new appraisal items. Version 1.0 will be released once all 8 junior appraiser items are in. The mod is expected to bring 32 new appraisal items in total — 8 per appraisal rank. Stay tuned!\n\n[h2]AI involvement[/h2]\nThe guides and text of this mod were produced with DeepSeek. The appraisal base art was made with Retro Diffusion Pro, and every variant of the appraisal art was hand-drawn by yours truly.\n\n[h2]Small talk[/h2]\nSince I play all sorts of games year-round, some anime characters may show up in future updates AwA (looking forward to it). In this release there is actually a nod to another game — [i]Aliya of the Beyond[/i] (彼方的她). See if you can find the easter egg :). This is the first mod I have ever made, and also my first attempt at hand-drawn pixel art, so there is plenty left to be desired — please bear with me. If you run into bugs, or have suggestions and feedback, put them in the comments first; I will put this on GitHub later, where you can file issues."
	"changenote"		"0.6.1：修复鉴定手册没有发放的问题（已入会的存档会补到柜台上）。"
}
